wolfvoice interoperates with, but does not include, the following third-party
projects:

  * os-webrtc-janus by Robert Adams (Mozilla Public License 2.0)
    https://github.com/Misterblue/os-webrtc-janus
    Supplies the OpenSimulator region-side capability handlers and the JSON-RPC
    connector that wolfvoice receives requests from.

  * OpenSimulator (BSD 3-Clause)
    http://opensimulator.org

  * Firestorm Viewer (LGPL 2.1) and the Second Life viewer sources
    https://www.firestormviewer.org
    The wire protocol implemented here is Linden Lab's, as documented in
    docs/PROTOCOL.md by reference to those sources.

libopus is compiled from source by the `opus` crate at build time and is
distributed under the BSD 3-Clause licence by Xiph.Org.
